              "id": "1a.1",
              "text": "A heatwave in Verlow prompted the Provincial Public Health Institute (PPHI) to issue warnings and deploy resources starting June 23, 2026. By June 25, service disruptions were reported at Verlow General Hospital due to grid strain from the heatwave. The network operator (Grennet Power) issued warnings related to the heatwave's impact on power infrastructure.",
